{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">港鐵將軍澳綫鰂魚涌站，晚上七時許懷疑有列車設備故障，期間行車受阻。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鰂魚涌站有消防員及港鐵職員在場，了解情況並疏導乘客，大批乘客聚集在月台候車。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.MTR-2100.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026XL6TdMpEJq1784208163.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.MTR-2100.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方指接獲市民報告，鰂魚涌站月台往寶琳方向懷疑有列車冒煙並傳出異味，消防到場後，無發現煙霧或火災。現場消息指，有關列車已離開月台。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-16T13:39:23.220549+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}